    exists( $stap_23 : Outcome( stack == "defaults A:Vondst.stapelheffing" && chain == 0 && position >= 0 && kind == dev.uchar.regelspraak.transpiler.tms.Outcome.Kind.DECIDED, subject != null, subject == $onderwerp, beta_defaultsAVondstStapelheffingOpenVerschilKeten0(this, $open_22) ) )
